7. The Child Knife

Tagline: “Why don’t you just unplug it?”

* Shape: small, direct, under-listened-to
* Comedy engine: obvious truth puncturing adult nonsense
* Competence: clarity, simplicity, literal observation
* Blind spot: diplomacy
* Pressure response: gets meaner and more correct
* Speech pattern: blunt, short, lethal
* Scene function: breaks overbuilt frames
* Shadow form: little tyrant / truth goblin
