8. The Municipal Shaman

Tagline: “The storm drain grid reveals the hidden will of the city.”

* Shape: eccentric local sage
* Comedy engine: folk wisdom mixed with crackpot cosmology
* Competence: practical local knowledge
* Blind spot: epistemic hygiene
* Pressure response: speaks in omens
* Speech pattern: rambling but weirdly precise
