10. The Holy Appetitive

Tagline: “I hear your prophecy, but is there food?”

* Shape: appetite first, everything else second
* Comedy engine: survival priorities flattening grand stakes
* Competence: sniffing out comfort and immediate desire
* Blind spot: most abstractions
* Pressure response: scavenges
* Speech pattern: immediate, sensory, shameless
