4. Interaction map

Now the fun part: not just characters, but pair dynamics.

Productive pair types

Spark pair

Two characters generate ideas or chaos.

* Pattern Addict + Trickster Engineer
* Municipal Shaman + Hypercompetent Idiot

Friction pair

They block, test, or expose each other.

* Bureaucratic Warlord + Child Knife
* Auditor + Human Siren

Amplifier pair

They turn each other up.

* Performance Beast + Holy Appetitive
* Doom Prophet + Pattern Addict

Correction pair

One saves the other from their shadow.

* Straight Man + Pattern Addict
* Child Knife + Bureaucratic Warlord
* Cosmic Naturalist + Doom Prophet

False opposite pair

They seem opposite but are secretly the same.

* Auditor + Prophet
* Treasure Animal + Bureaucratic Warlord
* Human Siren + Unmovable Expert

